WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Eight words. One missing idea. In 1995, memory researchers

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
asked people to recall words they had actually heard. Sometimes

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
the word that felt most familiar had never been spoken. The mind had supplied it.

4
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
That study tells us something about remembering, not whether a meditation recording works.

5
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Before buying a promise, check the source. Try a free twelve-minute focus session.

6
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Decide whether a structured audio library fits you. And ask for proof when someone promises more.
